0..77 Comment "// Rows as data: two effects in one row, each handler a fold that answers the"
78..149 Comment "// operation at the front of the row and forwards the rest, so handling"
150..226 Comment "// peels the row one effect at a time down to `Void`, where a program is its"
227..302 Comment "// result. The kernel replays every declaration here, so a program\'s row is"
303..374 Comment "// a claim it re-derives: an operation outside the row is a kernel type"
375..384 Comment "// error."
386..420 Comment "// `Either`, `StateOp` and `Prog`."
